  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 4th level, a necros can restore an undead creature they control to whatever state they wish, being able to alter it as though they were using the shapeshift ability of the Alteration sphere and being treated as though they had the perfect imitation talent. In addition, an undead controlled by the necros does not rot unless they desire.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/necros#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
